# ==============================================================
# TEST - TELEPORT PLATE (test server only, never for admins)
# ==============================================================
# Script type : walk
# Bind to     : -1841 73 1569 (the block UNDER the pressure plate
#               at -1841 74 1569)
# Import      : /script import walk <paste URL>, then click the block
#
# What it does:
#   Stepping on the plate teleports the player to -1844.5 66
#   1577.5 (feet there, centred on the block), facing north.
#   Same command form as MainMap/Maze/Maze_Teleport.msc, so if
#   this works, @bypass /tp works and the maze plates will too.
#
# Requires: nothing
# ==============================================================
@bypass /tp {{player.getName()}} -1844.5 66 1577.5 180 0
